  "description": "Vintage Forge – Authentic Western Typeface\nVintage Forge is a bold Western display typeface inspired by classic frontier signage and vintage saloon lettering. Featuring strong slab serifs and clean, powerful letterforms, it delivers an authentic Wild West look with timeless character.\nPerfect for posters, rustic branding, apparel, logos, signage, country-themed artwork, and retro design projects. Vintage Forge captures the true spirit of the frontier in every letter.",
